==========================================================================================
STRUCTURAL PRELIMINARY: what the parameters CANNOT reach in (M, C, K)
==========================================================================================
  dM spans rank 5 of 6 in the symmetric 3x3 space
  dC spans rank 4 of 6 in the symmetric 3x3 space
  dK spans rank 1 of 6 in the symmetric 3x3 space
  so 6-1 + 6-4 + 6-5 = 1 + 2 + 5 = 8 structural directions are unreachable.
  Unreachable: mass X-Y coupling; damping X-Y and Theta-Y; all of K but the yaw entry.
  NOTE: unreachable is NOT the same as orthogonal. That is what (*) decides.

==========================================================================================
THE TEST: null space of the ten matrix conditions (*)
==========================================================================================
  A nonzero null space IS the construction. A trivial one PROVES the impossibility.

